#: ../../site/installation.md:1
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../site/installation.md:3
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "环境要求"

#: ../../site/installation.md:5
msgid "CMake 3.25 or newer."
msgstr "CMake 3.25 或更高版本。"

#: ../../site/installation.md:6
msgid "A C++23 compiler: MSVC 19.4+, Clang 17+, or GCC 13+."
msgstr "支持 C++23 的编译器：MSVC 19.4+、Clang 17+ 或 GCC 13+。"

#: ../../site/installation.md:7
msgid "Git submodules for the pinned DataFrame, ImGui and ImPlot sources."
msgstr "用于固定版本 DataFrame、ImGui 和 ImPlot 源码的 Git 子模块。"

#: ../../site/installation.md:9
msgid ""
"The core library does not require Python, Doxygen or Sphinx at build time. "
"Those tools are only needed to build this documentation."
msgstr ""
"核心库在构建时不需要 Python、Doxygen 或 Sphinx。只有在构建本文档时才需要这些"
"工具。"

#: ../../site/installation.md:12
msgid "Build from a checkout"
msgstr "从检出的源码构建"

#: ../../site/installation.md:14
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/cloudQuant/fincore_cpp.git\n"
"cd fincore_cpp\n"
"git submodule update --init --recursive\n"
"cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release\n"
"cmake --build build --parallel\n"
"ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/cloudQuant/fincore_cpp.git\n"
"cd fincore_cpp\n"
"git submodule update --init --recursive\n"
"cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release\n"
"cmake --build build --parallel\n"
"ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure\n"

#: ../../site/installation.md:23
msgid ""
"On Windows, use a Visual Studio developer environment and a CMake generator "
"supported by the installed MSVC toolchain. The pinned submodule sources are "
"used by default; a consumer-provided DataFrame can be selected with "
"`FINCORE_DATAFRAME_SOURCE_DIR` or `find_package(DataFrame CONFIG)`."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，请使用 Visual Studio 开发人员环境以及已安装的 MSVC 工具链所支"
"持的 CMake 生成器。默认使用固定版本的子模块源码；可以通过 "
"`FINCORE_DATAFRAME_SOURCE_DIR` 或 `find_package(DataFrame CONFIG)` 选择使用方"
"提供的 DataFrame。"

#: ../../site/installation.md:28
msgid "Install and consume"
msgstr "安装与使用"

#: ../../site/installation.md:30
msgid "cmake --install build --prefix /path/to/prefix\n"
msgstr "cmake --install build --prefix /path/to/prefix\n"

#: ../../site/installation.md:34
msgid "A downstream CMake project can then use:"
msgstr "下游 CMake 项目随后可以使用："

#: ../../site/installation.md:36
msgid ""
"find_package(fincore CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS fincore)\n"
"target_link_libraries(my_target PRIVATE fincore::fincore)\n"
msgstr ""
"find_package(fincore CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS fincore)\n"
"target_link_libraries(my_target PRIVATE fincore::fincore)\n"

#: ../../site/installation.md:41
msgid ""
"The optional ImPlot component is available only when the library was built "
"with `FINCORE_BUILD_IMPLOT=ON` and its GUI dependencies are installed."
msgstr ""
"可选的 ImPlot 组件仅在库以 `FINCORE_BUILD_IMPLOT=ON` 构建且其 GUI 依赖已安装"
"时可用。"

#: ../../site/installation.md:44
msgid "Optional documentation build"
msgstr "可选的文档构建"

#: ../../site/installation.md:46
msgid ""
"python -m venv .venv-docs\n"
".venv-docs/bin/pip install -r docs/requirements-docs.txt\n"
"cd docs/site\n"
"doxygen Doxyfile\n"
"sphinx-build -b html -W -n --keep-going . ../_build/html/en\n"
msgstr ""
"python -m venv .venv-docs\n"
".venv-docs/bin/pip install -r docs/requirements-docs.txt\n"
"cd docs/site\n"
"doxygen Doxyfile\n"
"sphinx-build -b html -W -n --keep-going . ../_build/html/en\n"

#: ../../site/installation.md:54
msgid ""
"The exact commands for the supported platforms and the current validation "
"status are recorded in the repository's iteration-10 acceptance record."
msgstr ""
"受支持平台的确切命令以及当前验证状态记录在仓库的 iteration-10 验收记录中。"
